    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14795" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀργῐνόεις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εσσα</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀργός</span>
			, <i>bright-shining, white,</i> epith. of Lycastus and
			Camirus, from their lying on <i>chalky</i> hills, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.647
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				656
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῆσοι Ἀργινοῦσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					1.6.27
				</span></i>
			; of milk, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.23
			</span></i> (Antip. Sid.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαλινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.1607
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαστός,</span>
			
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀργάεις</span>
			 (q.v.), <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				4.8
			</span></i>.</div>
